Error [E0305]: multi-head variant `name` is not an enum variant
  --> tests/ui/params_not_yet.jet:1:10
    |
  1 | fn greet(name) {
    |          ^^^^
 Why: a multi-head table can only cover variants declared by an enum
 Fix: check the variant spelling or declare the enum first

Error [E0101]: this program has no `run` function
 Why: running a program starts at `fn run`, and the entry file doesn't define one
 Fix: add `fn run() { ... }` to the entry file
